            "VTE recurrence risk after stopping anticoagulation:",
            "• Provoked VTE (surgery): 1-3% per year (LOW)",
            "• Unprovoked VTE: 10% per year (HIGH) - 30% cumulative at 5 years",
            "• Recurrent unprovoked VTE: 15-20% per year (VERY HIGH)",
            "• Cancer-associated VTE: 15-20% per year (VERY HIGH)",
            "Men have 1.5-2× higher recurrence risk than women (same unprovoked VTE)",
            "Anticoagulation reduces recurrence by 90% (to ~1-2%/year)"
        ],
        "tags": ["respiratory", "VTE", "unprovoked VTE", "recurrence risk", "risk stratification", "week3"],
